<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru" class="h-full">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Архив Спецхрана-А | НКВД СССР [Конструктор и Анализатор МО]</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Special+Elite&family=VT323&family=PT+Serif:ital,wght@0,400;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .font-typewriter {
            font-family: 'Special Elite', monospace;
        }
        .font-terminal {
            font-family: 'VT323', monospace;
        }
        .font-document {
            font-family: 'PT Serif', serif;
        }
        
        /* Paper texture background */
        .paper-bg {
            background-color: #f4ecd0;
            background-image: radial-gradient(#e6dbb9 15%, transparent 16%), radial-gradient(#e3d6b0 15%, transparent 16%);
            background-size: 60px 60px;
            background-position: 0 0, 30px 30px;
        }

        /* CRT Terminal Theme background */
        .crt-bg {
            background-color: #081109;
            color: #34d399;
            background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%), linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.06), rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.02), rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.06));
            background-size: 100% 4px, 6px 100%;
        }

        /* CRT Scanline & Glow effects */
        .crt-scanlines {
            position: relative;
        }
        .crt-scanlines::before {
            content: " ";
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; right: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 50%);
            background-size: 100% 4px;
            z-index: 20;
            pointer-events: none;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        /* Red stamp effect */
        .soviet-stamp {
            border: 3px double #b91c1c;
            color: #b91c1c;
            font-weight: 900;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            display: inline-block;
            transform: rotate(-3deg);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            animation: stamp-pop 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes stamp-pop {
            0% { transform: scale(2) rotate(-10deg); opacity: 0; }
            100% { transform: scale(1) rotate(-3deg); opacity: 1; }
        }

        /* Redacted block styling */
        .redacted {
            background-color: #111;
            color: #111;
            cursor: pointer;
            user-select: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            padding: 0 4px;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .redacted.revealed {
            background-color: #fee2e2;
            color: #b91c1c;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #b91c1c;
        }

        .terminal-glow {
            text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.6);
        }

        /* Alarm flashing overlay */
        .alarm-active {
            animation: alarm-flash 0.8s infinite alternate;
        }
        @keyframes alarm-flash {
            0% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.1); }
            100% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 150px rgba(185, 28, 28, 0.6); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="h-full bg-zinc-950 text-zinc-800 font-document overflow-hidden">

    <!-- AUTHORIZATION SCREEN -->
    <div id="auth-screen" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-zinc-950 flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-[#f4ecd0] border-4 border-zinc-800 p-8 shadow-2xl relative paper-bg">
            <div class="absolute -top-4 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-red-800 text-white font-typewriter text-xs px-4 py-1 uppercase tracking-widest border border-red-900 shadow">
                Совершенно секретно • СК-А
            </div>
            
            <div class="text-center mb-6 mt-2">
                <h1 class="font-typewriter text-2xl font-bold tracking-wider text-zinc-900">СПЕЦХРАН-А НКВД СССР</h1>
                <p class="font-terminal text-sm text-zinc-600 mt-1">ЦЕНТРАЛЬНАЯ БАЗА МАТЕРИАЛЬНЫХ ОТКЛОНЕНИЙ</p>
            </div>

            <div class="border-t border-b border-zinc-400 py-3 my-3 font-typewriter text-xs text-zinc-700 space-y-2">
                <p>ВНИМАНИЕ! Доступ регламентирован Постановлением СНК СССР. Несанкционированный просмотр преследуется по ст. 58 УК РСФСР.</p>
                <p class="text-red-800 font-bold">Выберите уровень допуска или введите шифр:</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-3 font-typewriter">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 mb-1">Уровень допуска сотрудника:</label>
                    <select id="clearance-select" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border-2 border-zinc-700 p-2 text-sm text-zinc-900 font-typewriter focus:outline-none focus:border-red-800">
                        <!-- Dynamic Options populated by JS -->
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 mb-1">Табельный номер / Позывной:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="agent-id" value="Агент-42" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border-2 border-zinc-700 p-2 text-sm text-zinc-900 font-typewriter focus:outline-none focus:border-red-800">
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs font-bold text-zinc-700 mb-1">Секретный шифр повышения (опционально):</label>
                    <input type="password" id="secret-code" placeholder="LUBYANKA / BETA-1937" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border-2 border-zinc-700 p-2 text-sm text-zinc-900 font-typewriter focus:outline-none focus:border-red-800">
                </div>

                <button onclick="authorizeUser()" class="w-full bg-red-900 hover:bg-red-800 text-white font-typewriter py-3 font-bold tracking-widest uppercase border border-red-950 shadow-md transition-colors mt-2">
                    Авторизоваться в системе
                </button>
            </div>
            
            <div class="mt-4 text-center font-terminal text-xs text-zinc-500 flex justify-between items-center">
                <span>Система «Сито» активна. Протоколирование включено.</span>
                <button onclick="toggleAudio()" id="auth-sound-btn" class="text-zinc-700 underline text-[11px]">Звук: ВКЛ</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MAIN WORKSPACE -->
    <div id="main-app" class="h-full flex flex-col hidden">
        <!-- Top Terminal Status Bar -->
        <header class="bg-zinc-900 text-zinc-300 border-b-2 border-zinc-800 px-4 py-2 flex items-center justify-between font-terminal text-sm z-30">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-4">
                <span class="text-red-500 font-bold animate-pulse">● СВЯЗЬ С СЕТЬЮ УСТАНОВЛЕНА</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 md:space-x-4 text-xs md:text-sm">
                <span>ДОПУСК: <strong id="display-clearance" class="text-red-400 uppercase">ГАММА</strong></span>
                <span class="hidden sm:inline">ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЬ: <strong id="display-user" class="text-zinc-100">Агент-42</strong></span>
                
                <!-- Main Header Actions -->
                <button onclick="openCreateDocModal()" class="bg-red-900 hover:bg-red-800 text-red-100 px-2.5 py-1 border border-red-700 rounded font-terminal flex items-center gap-1 shadow">
                    <span>+ ДЕЛО</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openClearanceModal()" class="bg-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-800 text-blue-100 px-2.5 py-1 border border-blue-700 rounded font-terminal flex items-center gap-1 shadow">
                    <span>🔑 ДОПУСКИ</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openPasswordModal()" class="bg-purple-900 hover:bg-purple-800 text-purple-100 px-2.5 py-1 border border-purple-700 rounded font-terminal flex items-center gap-1 shadow">
                    <span>🔒 ПАРОЛЬ</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openScannerModal()" class="bg-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-800 text-amber-100 px-2.5 py-1 border border-amber-700 rounded font-terminal flex items-center gap-1 shadow">
                    <span>☢ СКАНЕР</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="openTerminalModal()" class="bg-emerald-900 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-emerald-200 px-2.5 py-1 border border-emerald-700 rounded font-terminal flex items-center gap-1 shadow">
                    <span>> ТЕРМИНАЛ</span>
                </button>
                <button onclick="toggleTheme()" id="theme-btn" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 border border-zinc-700 rounded">
                    ТЕМА: БУМАГА
                </button>
                <button onclick="toggleAudio()" id="sound-btn" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-1 border border-zinc-700 rounded">
                    ЗВУК: ВКЛ
                </button>
                <button onclick="lockSystem()" class="bg-red-950 hover:bg-red-900 text-red-200 px-2.5 py-1 border border-red-800 rounded">
                    ВЫХОД
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Main Content Area: Sidebar & Viewer -->
        <div class="flex-1 flex overflow-hidden">
            <!-- Sidebar Navigation & Search -->
            <nav id="sidebar" class="w-80 bg-zinc-900 border-r border-zinc-800 flex flex-col overflow-y-auto">
                <div class="p-4 border-b border-zinc-800 space-y-3">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                        <h2 class="font-typewriter text-xs text-red-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Каталог Спецхрана-А</h2>
                        <span id="doc-count" class="font-terminal text-xs text-zinc-500">8 дел</span>
                    </div>
                    <!-- Real-time search -->
                    <div class="relative">
                        <input type="text" id="archive-search" oninput="filterDocuments(this.value)" placeholder="Поиск по архиву..." class="w-full bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-700 rounded px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-zinc-200 font-typewriter focus:outline-none focus:border-red-600">
                    </div>
                    <!-- Category Filters -->
                    <div class="flex gap-1 font-terminal text-[11px] overflow-x-auto pb-1">
                        <button onclick="filterCategory('all')" class="cat-btn bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-zinc-700 active-cat">Все</button>
                        <button onclick="filterCategory('Нормативные акты')" class="cat-btn bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-zinc-700">Акты</button>
                        <button onclick="filterCategory('Материальные отклонения')" class="cat-btn bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-zinc-700">МО</button>
                        <button onclick="filterCategory('Журнал инцидентов')" class="cat-btn bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-zinc-700">Инциденты</button>
                        <button onclick="filterCategory('Пользовательские')" class="cat-btn bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-zinc-700">Свои</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div id="document-nav-list" class="p-2 space-y-1 font-typewriter text-xs flex-1">
                    <!-- Dynamic Document Navigation Buttons generated by JS -->
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 border-t border-zinc-800 font-terminal text-xs text-zinc-500 flex justify-between items-center bg-zinc-950">
                    <button onclick="exportUserData()" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 px-2 py-1 rounded text-[11px]">💾 Экспорт</button>
                    <label class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 px-2 py-1 rounded text-[11px] cursor-pointer">
                        📂 Импорт
                        <input type="file" id="import-file" onchange="importUserData(event)" accept=".json" class="hidden">
                    </label>
                    <button onclick="resetDatabase()" class="bg-red-950 hover:bg-red-900 text-red-300 px-2 py-1 rounded text-[11px]" title="Сбросить к заводским">🔄 Сброс</button>
                    <button onclick="printCurrentDocument()" class="bg-zinc-800 hover:bg-zinc-700 text-zinc-200 px-2 py-1 rounded text-[11px]">🖨️ Печать</button>
                </div>
            </nav>

            <!-- Main Document Viewer Area -->
            <main id="viewer-wrapper" class="flex-1 bg-zinc-900 p-6 overflow-y-auto flex justify-center items-start transition-colors duration-300">
                <div id="doc-container" class="max-w-3xl w-full bg-[#f4ecd0] text-zinc-900 border-2 border-zinc-700 shadow-2xl p-10 paper-bg relative min-h-[780px] flex flex-col transition-all">
                    <!-- Dynamic Document Content injected via JS -->
                </div>
            </main>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CREATE / EDIT DOCUMENT MODAL -->
    <div id="create-doc-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-2xl w-full bg-[#f4ecd0] border-4 border-zinc-800 p-6 shadow-2xl paper-bg text-zinc-900 font-typewriter max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col overflow-hidden">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-zinc-800 pb-2 mb-4">
                <h3 id="create-modal-title" class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 uppercase">СОЗДАНИЕ НОВОГО ДЕЛА СПЕЦХРАНА</h3>
                <button onclick="closeCreateDocModal()" class="text-zinc-700 font-bold hover:text-red-800 px-2 text-xl">✕</button>
            </div>

            <form id="create-doc-form" onsubmit="saveCustomDocument(event)" class="space-y-3 overflow-y-auto pr-2 flex-1 text-xs">
                <input type="hidden" id="edit-doc-key" value="">
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Индекс / Шифр дела:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="doc-input-id" required placeholder="Например: МО-512" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter focus:border-red-800">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Название дела:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="doc-input-title" required placeholder="Например: «Черный Туман»" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter focus:border-red-800">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Подзаголовок / Локация / Сектор:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="doc-input-subtitle" placeholder="Например: Спецобъект-12, Свердловская область" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter focus:border-red-800">
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Категория:</label>
                        <select id="doc-input-category" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter">
                            <option value="Материальные отклонения">Материальные отклонения</option>
                            <option value="Нормативные акты">Нормативные акты</option>
                            <option value="Журнал инцидентов">Журнал инцидентов</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Допуск:</label>
                        <select id="doc-input-clearance" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter">
                            <!-- Dynamic clearances -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Штамп / Гриф:</label>
                        <input type="text" id="doc-input-stamp" value="АРХИВ НКВД" placeholder="АРХИВ НКВД / ОПАСНО" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter focus:border-red-800">
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-1">
                        <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800">Текст документа:</label>
                        <button type="button" onclick="insertRedactedTag()" class="text-[10px] bg-zinc-800 text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded">Вставить [[Засекречено|уровень]]</button>
                    </div>
                    <textarea id="doc-input-content" rows="8" required placeholder="Введите текст дела... Для засекречивания фрагментов используйте формат: [[Засекреченный текст|уровень_цифра]]" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-document text-sm focus:border-red-800"></textarea>
                </div>

                <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end gap-3 border-t border-zinc-400">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closeCreateDocModal()" class="bg-zinc-700 text-white px-4 py-2 uppercase font-bold text-xs">Отмена</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="bg-red-900 hover:bg-red-800 text-white px-5 py-2 uppercase font-bold text-xs">Сохранить дело</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CLEARANCE MANAGEMENT MODAL -->
    <div id="clearance-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-lg w-full bg-[#f4ecd0] border-4 border-zinc-800 p-6 shadow-2xl paper-bg text-zinc-900 font-typewriter">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-zinc-800 pb-2 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase">УПРАВЛЕНИЕ УРОВНЯМИ ДОПУСКА</h3>
                <button onclick="closeClearanceModal()" class="text-zinc-700 font-bold hover:text-red-800 px-2 text-xl">✕</button>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4 text-xs">
                <div>
                    <p class="mb-2 text-zinc-700">Существующие уровни допуска в системе:</p>
                    <div id="clearance-list-container" class="space-y-1 max-h-36 overflow-y-auto bg-zinc-100 p-2 border border-zinc-400">
                        <!-- Dynamic list -->
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="border-t border-zinc-400 pt-3">
                    <h4 class="font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">Добавить новый допуск:</h4>
                    <form onsubmit="addNewClearance(event)" class="space-y-2">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block font-bold mb-1">Код допуска (англ.):</label>
                                <input type="text" id="new-clr-key" required placeholder="delta / zeta" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-1.5 font-typewriter">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block font-bold mb-1">Приоритет (число от 1 до 10):</label>
                                <input type="number" id="new-clr-level" required min="1" max="10" value="3" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-1.5 font-typewriter">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="block font-bold mb-1">Название на русском:</label>
                            <input type="text" id="new-clr-name" required placeholder="ДЕЛЬТА [Старший инспектор]" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-1.5 font-typewriter">
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex justify-end pt-2">
                            <button type="submit" class="bg-blue-900 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white px-4 py-2 uppercase font-bold">Добавить допуск</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- PASSWORD / SHIFT MODAL -->
    <div id="password-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-[#f4ecd0] border-4 border-zinc-800 p-6 shadow-2xl paper-bg text-zinc-900 font-typewriter">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b-2 border-zinc-800 pb-2 mb-4">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-purple-900 uppercase">СМЕНА ПАРОЛЯ И ШИФРОВ</h3>
                <button onclick="closePasswordModal()" class="text-zinc-700 font-bold hover:text-red-800 px-2 text-xl">✕</button>
            </div>

            <form onsubmit="savePasswordSettings(event)" class="space-y-3 text-xs">
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Ваш позывной / имя агента:</label>
                    <input type="text" id="pwd-modal-agent" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter" required>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Личный пароль доступа:</label>
                    <input type="password" id="pwd-modal-pass" placeholder="Новый личный пароль" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter">
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label class="block font-bold text-zinc-800 mb-1">Мастер-шифр повышения (например: LUBYANKA):</label>
                    <input type="text" id="pwd-modal-secret" placeholder="LUBYANKA или BETA-1937" class="w-full bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-700 p-2 font-typewriter">
                </div>

                <div class="pt-2 flex justify-end gap-2 border-t border-zinc-400">
                    <button type="button" onclick="closePasswordModal()" class="bg-zinc-700 text-white px-3 py-2 uppercase font-bold">Отмена</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="bg-purple-900 hover:bg-purple-800 text-white px-4 py-2 uppercase font-bold">Сохранить пароль</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ANOMALY SCANNER MODAL -->
    <div id="scanner-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-sm hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="max-w-xl w-full bg-zinc-950 border-2 border-amber-600 rounded shadow-2xl overflow-hidden crt-scanlines flex flex-col font-terminal text-amber-400 p-6 space-y-4">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-amber-800 pb-2">
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-wider">☢ СПЕЦ-СКАНЕР АНОМАЛИЙ «ВЕКТОР-2»</h3>
                <button onclick="closeScannerModal()" class="text-amber-600 hover:text-white font-bold text-xl">✕</button>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-amber-500">Система анализа физических, биологических и пси-излучений объектов Спецхрана.</p>

            <div class="space-y-3 bg-zinc-900 p-4 border border-amber-900 rounded">
                <div>
                    <label class="block text-xs mb-1">Выберите дело для спектрального анализа:</label>
                    <select id="scanner-doc-select" class="w-full bg-zinc-950 border border-amber-700 text-amber-300 p-2 font-terminal">
                        <!-- Dynamic options -->
                    </select>
                </div>

                <button onclick="runAnomalyScan()" class="w-full bg-amber-900 hover:bg-amber-800 text-amber-100 py-2 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-amber-700">
